                     "24x24" : "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/9415554eef74e2169ce3e459c177ff75?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FLP-4.png",
                     "32x32" : "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/9415554eef74e2169ce3e459c177ff75?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FLP-4.png",
                     "48x48" : "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/9415554eef74e2169ce3e459c177ff75?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FLP-4.png"
                  },
                  "displayName" : "Lewis Pringle",
                  "self" : "https://stroika.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=557058%3A4fe560ca-b4e1-41d1-9bdf-97b1684eda32",
                  "timeZone" : "America/New_York"
               },
               "body" : {
                  "content" : [
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "Bag is like a Collection, except that iterating selects  a random path through the container.",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : " ",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "pick a random elt from the collection",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "       (maybe in iterable- maybe better in Collection – to be like the BAG API",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "             OR maybe do the Bag api I had consider. That later maybe best",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "             Cuz todo well needs virtual method on collection to pick an item randomly",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "       from the bag. Maybe bag is like Collection, exceptwithh a randonmnumbergenrateor associated with its constructor?",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "Iteration random, and pick method which removes a random element from the bag.",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : " Simulate the idea of a bag (for a game) bag of eleemnts;",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "could be implemented as an aray. And each time you create a new iterator, create a VECTOR of random indexes(size of array) - and select elts from teh array randomly each time.",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "Somewhat expensive todo that way, but the alterantive is that as you itearte you have to keep track of what you’ve seen, and that is expensive too.",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "Cheapear is ‘Pick’ method. Wheihc does selection with replacmeent, so no need to keep the array - just when creating an interator.",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : " ",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     }
